  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digitization of Seed Potato Information system</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is part of the larger initiative at national level to create a sustainable framework that supports adaptive capacities within Eritrea&#x2019;s agriculture sector by improving information flow and capacity building of farmers through digital channels. It also complements the joint Vita Impact /Ministry of Agriculture / European Union project &#x201C;Multi-Stakeholder Coordination and Community Based Organisation Harnessing for Improved Potato Seed Systems and Value Chains that will be implemented over the coming three years. At a cost of &#xA3;30,000.00, this micro-project will be implemented over a period of three months.</narrative>
  </description>
